@startuml
|Lecturer|
start
:Request list of project deliverables;

|DeliverablesManagementInterface|
:Display list of project deliverables;

|DeliverablesController|
:Retrieve project deliverables;

|DeliverablesService|
:Fetch project deliverables from storage;

|DeliverablesService|
:Return project deliverables;

|DeliverablesManagementInterface|
:Display project deliverables to Lecturer;

:View deliverable details;

|DeliverablesController|
:Retrieve specific deliverable details;

|DeliverablesService|
:Fetch deliverable details from storage;

|DeliverablesService|
:Return deliverable details;

|DeliverablesManagementInterface|
:Display deliverable details to Lecturer;

:Remove deliverable;

|DeliverablesController|
:Process removal of deliverable;

|DeliverablesService|
:Delete deliverable from storage;

if (Removal successful?) then (yes)
    :Notify student of removal;

    |NotificationService|
    :Send removal notification to student;

    |NotificationService|
    :Confirm notification sent;
else (Removal failed)
    :Return error status;
endif

|DeliverablesService|
:Return removal status;

|DeliverablesController|
:Update deliverables management status;

|DeliverablesManagementInterface|
:Display final deliverables management status;
stop
@enduml